# Agent skills (project)

Before non-trivial technical work, route through project skills under `.cursor/skills/`:

1. **addyosmani/agent-skills** — specs, implementation, review, tests  
   Start with `using-agent-skills` when choosing a workflow.
2. **obra/superpowers** — brainstorm → plan → TDD → review → finish  
   Prefixed as `superpowers-*` (e.g. `superpowers-brainstorming`, `superpowers-test-driven-development`).
3. **browser-harness** — drive a real Chrome browser via CDP for manual verification.

Do not paste entire skill bodies into rules. Read the matching `SKILL.md` when the task fits.
